    {
      "target": "docs/learn/fundamentals/light.md",
      "change": "The evanescent-incidence identity is kx/k0 = n cosh(alpha), not kx = n cosh(alpha); the missing normalization is corrected in both English and Korean prose. Equations, solver input, and recorded numerical data are otherwise preserved."
