    {
      "target": "docs/learn/fundamentals/backends.md",
      "change": "Both English and Korean explicitly identify wavebit.enable_x64() as the wavebit.compat.legacy alias; importing the new wavebit root does not change JAX x64. Original author source and initial translation hashes remain unchanged; published and Korean-overlay hashes record this clarification."
